"宋"}},{"title":"初过大散关马上作","author":"石介","text":"柰何山色牵吟思，旋被江声破睡魔。\n吟思睡魔两相战，谁知马上有干戈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":26379,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初过潼关值雨","author":"石介","text":"二十年来忆华山，扬鞭西笑入秦川。\n浮云何苦深遮闭，岂是三峰不好贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":26380,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李英公绩","author":"石介","text":"一言容易废忠谋，徇主从昏可自尤。\n今日始知辜付托，当时齧指血空流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":26381,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泥溪驿中作","author":"石介","text":"山驿萧条酒倦倾，嘉陵相背去无情。\n临流不忍轻相别，吟听潺湲坐到明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":26382,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨晴复赋一绝","author":"石介","text":"过关何事懒摇鞭，酷爱三峰落马前。\n天气清明新雨后，山光日色满秦川。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":26383,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"剑门读贾公疏诗石","author":"石介","text":"剑门驻马立踟蹰，读尽新篇味有馀。\n关令多情兼好事，诗名留得贾公疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":26384,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"峡中","author":"石介","text":"路狭才容飞鸟过，山将生合柰山何。\n不知天外山长短，何事窥来一